{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STRANGE BREW is a cinematic 3D action platformer with intense chases that feel like a zombie movie. Run to evade, throw beans to distract, and use environmental traps to slow, smash or zap the hordes. Expect non-stop mayhem, absurd story beats, screams/laughs, as you play as a duck mascot with a coffee addiction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/e06cfbe0a4f22d29057f05c451019bb9.poster.avif?t=1773885989\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/e06cfbe0a4f22d29057f05c451019bb9.webm?t=1773885989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUN FROM THE DECAFFEINATED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop or throw coffee beans to lure and trick zombie hordes. Be clever. To top the leaderboard, Joe must take risks to orchestrate mass murders for monster point totals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/e14f583aadec71cf1c386add3178be80.poster.avif?t=1773885989\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/e14f583aadec71cf1c386add3178be80.webm?t=1773885989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILL \u2018EM ALL, IF YOU MUST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect to always be chased and harassed. Swat through the chaos, leap from tall buildings, and make good use of environmental hazards. Save yourself to take the fight to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/bfb8522e9ff9336602882ede80f75123.poster.avif?t=1773885989\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/bfb8522e9ff9336602882ede80f75123.webm?t=1773885989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EMBRACE THE MADNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Brew is awash in atmospherics and cinematic moments. Find yourself behind the DJ booth at a warehouse rave, or atop a monorail screaming out of control, or summiting the nuclear cooling tower. Drink it up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/fd354da01abd92f9b106874ecc0fc5f8.poster.avif?t=1773885989\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499670/extras/fd354da01abd92f9b106874ecc0fc5f8.webm?t=1773885989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEEL FREE TO REPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek different paths to unlock secrets, like fabulous additional costumes.\u00a0 Switch to the '68 Living Dead Mode to experience this apocalypse in black-and-white.<br><br>It was the end of civilization and there was no coffee. <br>There was no coffee and it was the end of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Testing Achivement","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499670/86135adb65a21a1479d021b5f2465d769e6e7f36.jpg"},{"name":"Died in the Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea